WEBVTT

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:46.020
<i>As of now, we have finished</i>
<i>four of the five matches.</i>

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.640
<i>It's three to one!</i>

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.310
In other words...

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:55.320
The Chinese Allied Powers
can no longer win!

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.740
Even if we win the final match,

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:00.320
our team's defeat has been decided.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:06.200
Our proud Chinese supporters
are full of despair.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.790
They're full of despair!

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:11.130
<i>At that moment...</i>

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.170
Yujiro!

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:19.010
The Japan-US victors' captain.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:25.430
Five to zero.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:28.270
We'll get a perfect win.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:29.890
Those...

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:34.360
were words of Sea Emperor Kaku,
the Chinese Allied Powers' chief.

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:37.900
They broke their promise.

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:41.410
China's dignified
4,000 years of martial arts

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:44.410
and the Sea King and Sea Emperor titles

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:47.410
are still standing tall.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.250
Four thousand years
of Chinese martial arts

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.830
and hundreds of thousands
of martial artists

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.420
have disappeared without showing
the complete form of Kung Fu you wanted.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:00.430
Some have fallen ill,

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.930
some cried after an injury,

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:07.430
and some quit because they couldn't endure
the agonizing training.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.520
Some died of old age too.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.020
Here and now,

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.770
one miraculous being
reached a complete form

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.530
without falling to any obstacles.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.160
This man has been called
the master of masters

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.030
and has reached the summit
that no others could.

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:29.040
He has lived for more than 100 years.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.790
This man has reached the end of the path,

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:35.290
never forgetting
or drifting from the martial arts.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.590
You can be proud of him.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:42.630
Sea Emperor Kaku
is an embodiment of Chinese Kenpo.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.470
If I lose here,

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:50.140
the three previous wins
will have no meaning whatsoever.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.060
Hello.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:00.690
Begin!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.590
Get on.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.590
Thank you.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.570
Sea Emperor Kaku.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.200
Yes?

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:47.620
To get to where you are now,

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.450
what did you sacrifice
and what did you gain?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.120
Money? Friends?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.880
Women? Alcohol?

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:03.630
You had a lot of time
where you could've lived in peace.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.930
You voluntarily dived into

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:11.510
more than a hundred years
of agonizing training.

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:15.890
What did you obtain and what did you lose?

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.270
Answer me.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:24.400
Listen, Strong One of Japan.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:26.990
I'm sure you understand.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.580
In the 4,000 years
of Chinese martial arts history,

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:34.410
no man admired power more than I did.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.920
I'd do anything for power.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:41.920
Listen, Strong One.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:43.920
Women,

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:46.630
friends, alcohol,

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.680
blood, and honor.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:54.180
I didn't hesitate to even throw away
my parents and siblings.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:59.190
Or rather, the strength that I accumulated
each and every day

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.190
intoxicated me so much that I lost myself.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:10.700
For a person like me, what was
the hardest thing to let go of?

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:13.200
It was power.

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.950
My body was burning with a lust for power.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.210
Letting go of that power
pained me the most.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:24.340
In all of Chinese history,

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.300
the one who wanted power most was me.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.260
I had once obtained power

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:32.720
and abandoned that power.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:35.720
Compared to that level of regret,

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:40.850
even the death of a relative
is insignificant.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:47.490
<i>One hundred years ago,</i>
<i>my body was covered with steel.</i>

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:51.570
<i>Using any muscle training imaginable,</i>

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:57.500
<i>my small frame became equipped with</i>
<i>highly dense muscles.</i>

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:02.000
<i>I was probably the number one in Asia</i>
<i>for pure strength.</i>

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:06.710
<i>I showed off my strength,</i>
<i>and did crazy feats.</i>

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:14.010
<i>I'd laugh at the logic of martial arts,</i>
<i>calling it a complete lie.</i>

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.350
<i>I continued proving that it was a lie.</i>

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.100
<i>But one day,</i>

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.310
<i>I met the real thing.</i>

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:29.110
<i>He was an old figure</i>
<i>who was over 60 years old.</i>

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:34.030
<i>His strength felt too poor</i>
<i>to be called strength.</i>

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:37.030
<i>But I was struck, kicked,</i>

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.870
<i>and beaten down.</i>

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.040
<i>I was defeated by martial arts logic.</i>

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.040
<i>That day was my turning point.</i>

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:49.510
<i>I threw away all of my training equipment.</i>

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:54.930
<i>And at the same time,</i>
<i>that meant saying farewell to my muscles.</i>

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.680
<i>I trained to obtain that logic.</i>

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:03.770
<i>Compared to how fast</i>
<i>my strength training went,</i>

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.610
<i>it felt excruciatingly long.</i>

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:11.440
<i>Every day, I saw my body</i>
<i>slowly going back to its normal form,</i>

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:12.780
<i>and I gritted my teeth.</i>

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:17.200
<i>No matter how blessed</i>
<i>or how agonizing your days are,</i>

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:22.710
<i>people begin to adapt to the environment</i>
<i>and eventually get used to it.</i>

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:24.960
<i>Many days passed</i>

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:28.880
<i>and my muscles continued to</i>
<i>disappear from my body.</i>

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:32.970
<i>When I passed 90 years old,</i>
<i>my skin sagged from my bones,</i>

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:37.470
<i>and my bowl and chopsticks felt heavy.</i>

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:43.060
<i>That's when I obtained martial arts logic.</i>

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.480
LOGIC

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.020
I see.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.820
Then this fight

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:57.370
is for logic to challenge strength.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.870
It's the opposite, Yujiro.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.870
Martial arts isn't challenging strength.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.620
Strength is challenging the martial arts.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.130
You are challenging me.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.680
<i>Sea Emperor Kaku, are you aware?</i>

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:24.640
<i>Do you know who</i>
<i>the man you're looking down on is</i>

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:26.890
<i>and how powerful he is?</i>

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.320
Can I watch the match

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:34.190
from here?

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:38.200
Of course.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:41.950
It has finally begun.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.750
Ultimate strength versus ultimate logic.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.790
Ultimate force versus ultimate technique.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:54.210
Ultimate violence
versus ultimate martial arts.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:02.970
Come and get me.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:13.690
Shaori!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.190
SHAORI

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:31.830
He dodged it!

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.210
No.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.380
It hit.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:37.970
He used Shaori.

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:39.970
And it was at an incredible level.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.270
He dislocated his jaw on purpose

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.860
to absorb the impact.

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.110
Are you saying

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.440
my old man's attack hit?

00:10:58.360 --> 00:10:59.860
That's Shaori.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:02.490
<i>In both east and west,</i>

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.950
<i>the time-honored key</i>
<i>to self-defense and martial arts</i>

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:11.080
<i>is to relax, as shown in Master Fencer</i>
<i>Miyamoto Musashi's self-portrait.</i>

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:14.920
<i>Combat is an exchange of life and death,</i>

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:18.880
<i>and it's an emergency</i>
<i>where we engage all our muscles.</i>

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:22.220
<i>Just like holding a child's hand.</i>

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.810
<i>Just like keeping an egg safe.</i>

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.890
<i>These abstract ideas show</i>
<i>a mastery of relaxation.</i>

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:33.650
<i>Past and present martial artists</i>
<i>have struggled</i>

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.980
<i>with relaxing in emergency situations.</i>

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:40.650
It's easier said than done.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:45.030
<i>Despite having a decisive blow</i>
<i>like Hanma's right in front of him,</i>

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.780
<i>he relaxed splendidly.</i>

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.250
<i>It's as hard to control</i>

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:52.540
<i>as swinging a razor down</i>
<i>on a tissue in mid-air.</i>

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:55.380
I'm still too inexperienced

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.380
to imitate it.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:01.880
Did my old man use his full force?

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:04.260
Look at the wall.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.140
Glasses that are as light as an eraser

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.850
are stuck in the wall.

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:16.230
I'm sure he kicked with full force.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.460
Quite impressive, Strong One.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.960
How many decades has it been
since I had a nosebleed?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.970
He can even handle attacks from above,
which is Shaori's weakness.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.430
Sea Emperor, what mastery.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:49.640
My old man's moves...

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:54.100
Yujiro Hanma's moves don't work on him?

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:01.730
How great.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.200
I guess things like Chinese Kenpo

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:06.990
are just for playing around.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:08.530
Is that so?

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.830
Shaori?

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:17.460
Shaori, a high-level technique in
Chinese martial arts since ancient times.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.130
<i>We stiffen up when danger approaches.</i>

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.760
<i>This is an inevitable reaction</i>
<i>for animals.</i>

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:29.430
<i>However, such instincts</i>
<i>make the situation worse.</i>

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:33.140
<i>Even if heavy winds</i>
<i>topple over giant trees,</i>

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:37.140
<i>wind does not affect the soft vegetation.</i>

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.650
<i>Some adults carelessly trip</i>
<i>and break a bone,</i>

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.650
<i>while a baby falls</i>
<i>from a high area unharmed.</i>

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:47.150
<i>It's wisdom learned from nature.</i>

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.700
<i>Boxers go through long training</i>

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:54.160
<i>and eventually stop blinking when hit.</i>

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:58.920
In other words,
training is for overcoming your instincts.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.670
Sea Emperor Kaku.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:06.170
I'll bring back your instincts.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.510
Is he saying

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.350
he'll beat the Shaori?

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:12.600
That man

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:14.770
doesn't bluff.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:17.770
He'll beat the Shaori

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:20.560
in an unpredictable way.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.070
It's gotten interesting,

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.070
Strong One.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:28.990
<i>He's moving.</i>

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:30.950
<i>The Sea Emperor is going first.</i>

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:34.080
Just you try.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.960
<i>My hair?</i>

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.390
<i>I didn't see that coming,</i>

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.100
<i>Yujiro Hanma!</i>

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:02.150
<i>By pulling out one strand of hair,</i>

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:06.230
<i>his body unwittingly stiffens up</i>
<i>a tiny bit.</i>

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:10.610
<i>Just as it sounds, he didn't miss</i>
<i>his timing even by a hair.</i>

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.620
<i>What mastery.</i>

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:15.490
You're a genius.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.380
That was a close call.

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.460
Right, Strong One?

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.380
You almost died.

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:34.510
You can believe these words

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.510
or you can doubt them.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.390
What is he saying?

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:41.100
I don't know, but...

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:42.650
that man

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:46.270
is someone who never bluffs.

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:52.070
Although I'm saying this,
I can only do old geezer punches.

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.660
It's no big deal.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.620
Try it.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:05.170
He dodged.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.710
My old man...

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:08.250
ran away!

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:16.970
What's this? Did you run away
from this weak old geezer's punch?

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.680
What is happening?

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.190
Well, then.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.110
Old man!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.070
Well, well.

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.740
Why is that Japanese guy running?

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:36.660
And he's cornered now.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.660
The great Yujiro Hanma...

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.200
is on the wall.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.960
That idiot, what is he wimping out for?

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:49.250
Your cowardice makes it hard to believe
you were called

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.460
the Strongest Creature on Earth.

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:57.970
Strong One, what are you afraid of?

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:02.680
What's so scary?

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.990
Is he a monster?

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:15.820
I've been found out.

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:18.450
You sly fox.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.080
I thought as much.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.500
It's Shaori!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.460
<i>Shaori makes you lose body mass,</i>

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.630
<i>but also relaxes your body.</i>

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:32.250
<i>The punch he unleashed</i>
<i>comes from extreme relaxation.</i>

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:36.260
The Defensive Shaori turns into
an Offensive Shaori.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:42.890
In other words,
Shaori is the relaxation of your body.

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.140
<i>Even outside of fighting and martial arts,</i>

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:51.020
<i>relaxation is used in modern sports</i>
<i>when explosive power is needed.</i>

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:53.780
<i>Pitching, batting,</i>

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:56.110
<i>throwing, and hitting.</i>

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:00.280
All of them focus on impact.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.290
You relax up until that moment.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:06.000
Relax your body until the impact.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.870
The more you relax, the better.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:14.050
That is why superior athletes
have softer muscles.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:18.050
The extreme shift in relaxation to tension
is the key to power.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.050
Then it's possible.

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:24.520
That absurdly powerful punch makes sense.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.520
That's amazing!

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.610
A Japanese guy 100 times bigger than him

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:34.110
was sent into the air!

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:37.530
My dad's over 100 kilograms and yet...

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.790
Strong One, does this make you happy?

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:55.800
He's strong.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:58.880
I didn't know such a strong man existed.

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:05.810
You may have never met me
if you took one different turn in life.

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:10.560
But by some turn of fate,
you found me, a worthy opponent.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.770
I'm happy about it too.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.820
Living long isn't so bad.

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.190
What?

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:21.610
You have lived way too long, old geezer.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:26.370
You're so senile that you haven't noticed
something important.

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.880
You're in big trouble, old geezer.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.340
Retsu, was that...

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:44.850
There's no way.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.720
Yujiro...

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.060
is using Shaori!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:11.210
Is that what the Sea Emperor did earlier?

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.120
Shaori...

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:15.540
Did he copy it by just watching?

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:17.380
The secret art of Shaori?

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.760
Did he learn it or already know it?

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:28.720
Did you copy me, Strong One?

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:32.600
I have been hearing for 20 years

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:36.440
that the strongest man on Earth
is in Japan.

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:40.980
You live up to your name
as a superb genius.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.910
I'm sure your opponents until now
weren't satisfying.

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:48.910
Isn't life fun?

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:50.990
We got to meet like this.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.330
My Shaori and your Shaori.

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:56.920
-Let's see which is real--
-Don't worry, geezer.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:57.920
What?

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:01.000
I'll never use the Shaori again.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:02.710
What?

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:10.890
I was poking fun at how you
showed off your moves.

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.430
It's not my normal fighting style.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:17.440
Oh, the young one has his own style?

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:31.200
-Amazing!
-Those biceps are huge.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:33.000
They're like metal.

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.730
Do you get it, old geezer?

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:01.570
Fighting is about liberating your power.

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:06.400
That cathartic release is impossible
without exerting strength.

00:22:09.740 --> 00:22:14.120
I haven't felt this much tension
in 100 years.

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.210
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:51.010
Subtitle translation by Chul Kim
